203
00:12:16,599 --> 00:12:23,626
[SPEAKER_04]: And Jen Belanger, who is joining us as the MTA representative as a teacher and also as a community member and parent.

204
00:12:24,507 --> 00:12:34,518
[SPEAKER_04]: And then Kim Clinton will be joining us as our incoming assistant superintendent for special education and student services as a non voting member, replacing Joan Bowen.

205
00:12:35,432 --> 00:12:37,573
