988
01:26:41,300 --> 01:26:53,944
[SPEAKER_05]: Up on level three, and the reason that the fitness center is moving is because there was the desire to get the locker rooms to be at the same elevation as the gym to be more universally accessible in terms of their position.

989
01:26:53,964 --> 01:27:00,106
