[SPEAKER_04]: Matt, can you flip back to the recommendation page?

1217
01:49:44,118 --> 01:50:01,423
[SPEAKER_04]: There is a recommendation before us to reduce the number of seats in the auditorium and accordingly the square feet from 1,000 seats to 750 seats, which changes the square footage by 2,500 square feet of usable space plus the grossing factor.

1218
01:50:03,064 --> 01:50:05,404
[SPEAKER_04]: Is there a motion to approve?

1219
01:50:06,025 --> 01:50:06,765
[SPEAKER_19]: Motion to approve.

1220
