1315
01:57:26,105 --> 01:57:30,993
[SPEAKER_14]: Our current size is around 1,200 square feet, so 2,000 is about double.

1316
01:57:33,879 --> 01:57:37,300
[SPEAKER_14]: And the other one, the chorus orchestra, that's also a space we have.

1317
01:57:38,701 --> 01:57:40,882
[SPEAKER_14]: In the current facility, that's 1,300 square feet.

1318
01:57:41,202 --> 01:57:42,642
[SPEAKER_14]: So we are increasing it.

1319
01:57:42,943 --> 01:57:54,327
