1325
01:58:32,799 --> 01:58:44,112
[SPEAKER_05]: What I can say in terms of the art classrooms, I'm fairly certain that amongst the three existing rooms that are currently in there, that that square footage total is well above the 1,200 square feet.

1326
01:58:45,453 --> 01:58:46,734
[SPEAKER_05]: because there are three rooms.

1327
01:58:47,154 --> 01:58:50,456
[SPEAKER_05]: I don't think it's too dissimilar from the overall 3,600 square feet.

1328
01:58:50,836 --> 01:58:55,519
