1341
02:00:20,960 --> 02:00:21,420
[SPEAKER_25]: He's right.

1342
02:00:21,701 --> 02:00:24,441
[SPEAKER_25]: It's one of those, like, tiered, um, approaches.

1343
02:00:25,021 --> 02:00:35,443
