[SPEAKER_04]: Great.

1610
02:21:56,878 --> 02:21:58,723
[SPEAKER_04]: We will get them posted after the board meeting tomorrow.

1611
02:21:59,786 --> 02:22:00,107
[SPEAKER_14]: Thank you.

1612
02:22:03,015 --> 02:22:03,818
[SPEAKER_04]: Any other questions?

1613
02:22:10,858 --> 02:22:15,581
[SPEAKER_04]: I just wanted to say thank you to the team who has worked really, really hard to get us here.

1614
02:22:18,083 --> 02:22:19,724
[SPEAKER_04]: This has been a tremendous amount of work.

1615
02:22:20,565 --> 02:22:23,366
[SPEAKER_04]: We've been at this for more than two and a half years now.

1616
02:22:23,386 --> 02:22:25,368
[SPEAKER_04]: It does feel like an eternity.

1617
02:22:25,428 --> 02:22:33,473
[SPEAKER_04]: And it's so exciting to see real spaces starting to look like spaces on a map that you might be able to find someday in real life.

1618
02:22:33,513 --> 02:22:35,134
[SPEAKER_04]: So it's super exciting.

1619
02:22:36,955 --> 02:22:45,937
[SPEAKER_04]: And, you know, I've had the chance to read the detailed comments from MSBA and the responses that we were asked to provide.

1620
02:22:46,877 --> 02:22:55,039
[SPEAKER_04]: And I'll just say that they continue to tell us in every way that they're very supportive of this project.

1621
02:22:56,260 --> 02:23:06,322
[SPEAKER_04]: The glowing comments from our facilities assessment review were certainly reflected in the comments around the spaces and the clarifications they were seeking.

1622
02:23:07,122 --> 02:23:12,044
[SPEAKER_04]: And it's all really exciting and it has taken a tremendous amount of work.

1623
02:23:12,064 --> 02:23:24,410
[SPEAKER_04]: So thank you to the SMMA team and to the left field team and to our district leaders who have a very full-time job outside of building a new school, which is not what they went to school to do.

1624
02:23:26,050 --> 02:23:31,353
[SPEAKER_04]: This is a tremendous amount of work and I cannot stress enough how hard everybody is working

1625
02:23:32,393 --> 02:23:38,536
[SPEAKER_04]: To bring this to fruition, so my sincere, thank you to everybody who is involved in moving this project forward.

1626
